Seven Kingdoms

Left mouse button  choose a unit, a building or a button
Right mouse button  move, attack, or go into a building
Pointer at the screen's edge or the small map  scroll
Ctrl + 1 to 9  make a team, Alt + 1 to 9  choose it again
F1 to F9  the reports (kingdoms, towns, economy, trade, army, tech, spies, rank, news)
F10  game menu (save, load, options, quit)
Right Amiga + F1 (F11)  a screenshot
Esc  back to the map
